repin_and_launch_gate54a.sh — the LAUNCH ACTION for the gate54a kit (the directory this script lives in). ONE PR, whose number and head are
INPUTS. Re-pin and launch are ONE action (Kam 2026-09-18): it READS everything AT LAUNCH and never trusts a pin it did not just re-read.
A NEW COPY of repin_and_launch_gate54f.sh, re-keyed for gate54a (pane QA/Secuura-ks1402-<PR>, 5 paths, the co-tenant census classes):
  (0)  the pane QA/Secuura-ks1402-<PR> is routed (inbox_routing.conf) — rc 1;
  (1)  the GitHub PULLS API: head sha, branch, base, state, merged, mergeable (re-read up to 3x while null) — rc 3; the PR body is saved;
  (2)  ONE `git ls-remote` READ from the Secuura checkout: develop + refs/pull/<PR>/head + the branch — rc 2;
  (2b) the OVERLAP census over every OTHER open PR (gh_census_gate54a.py): rc 15 on an OVERLAP; EXPECTED CO-TENANTs (Seat B 57th's
       stacked KS-1015 PR B, Seat D 2nd's KS-1404 docs PR) are REPORTED, never refused, never sequenced;
  (3)  rc 11 unless HEAD == the API head == pull/head == the branch (WHOLE-FIELD), the PR is open, not merged, based on develop, not
       `mergeable: false`, and the branch matches kit branch_rx;
  (3b) STALE BASE: rc 10 if origin develop != kit base (every C1-C6 expectation is drafted against e6daa806e79a: a move is a RE-DRAFT);
  (3c) FILL: fill_gate54a.py writes the prompt, the launcher and pins_gate54a.json from the values read in (1)-(3) — rc 10 on refusal;
  (3d) RACE: develop and the head re-read by ls-remote AFTER the fill — rc 10 / 11 if either moved meanwhile;
  (4)  G54A_* overrides refuse a real launch — rc 16;  (5) the usage gate — rc 12;  (6) the filled launcher's own --check — rc 13
       (it also refuses a pin older than 30 min, exit 9: STALE PIN);  (7) cockpit.sh add — rc 14, then a pane census.
--dry-run: steps 0-3d with the fill done as a SIMULATION (`dry<HHMMSS>.SIM.*`, never the real pins), then the SIM launcher's --check; the
routing line's absence is REPORTED, not refused; it stops before (4). READ-ONLY in the Secuura checkout: ls-remote (and `git log` inside the
census' stack test) only. Nothing is merged, deployed or commented. Every step's output is written beside this script as launch_<HHMMSS>.*
(dry: dry_<HHMMSS>.*). Controls-only overrides: G54A_ROUTING (routing file), G54A_COTENANTS (a JSON file standing in for kit co_tenants),
G54A_OVERLAP_EXTRA (an extra kit path for the census).
Usage: repin_and_launch_gate54a.sh <PR number> <HEAD 40-hex> [--dry-run]
set -u
GS="$(dirname "$(/bin/realpath "$0")")"
CHECKOUT='/Volumes/DevMASTER/!CODING/Secuura/Blockchain/2_Project_Files'
KJ() { python3 -c 'import json,sys; print(json.load(open(sys.argv[1]))[sys.argv[2]])' "$GS/kit.json" "$1"; }
